# Node / Remotion (large + reproducible — never commit)
**/node_modules/
**/.remotion/
**/out/

# Persisted Transfermarkt session cookie — secret, machine-local
.Storage/update-data-cookie.json
.Storage/update-data-cookie.json.tmp

# YouTube OAuth secrets + tokens — machine-local, NEVER commit
.Storage/youtube/

# Shared Remotion public cache (regenerated by each project's `npm run build-data`)
# Ignore everything under .remotion-shared (the huge synced public/ cache)…
/.remotion-shared/*
# …but DO track the shared source library (code, not regenerated assets).
!/.remotion-shared/src/
